cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this reproducibility package, please cite the associated manuscript and this archived release."
title: "HCC MRI Segmentation Reproducibility Package"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-01"
type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Sgourakis"
    given-names: "George"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7900-2003"

abstract: >
  Reproducibility package accompanying an HCC MRI segmentation study using
  five-fold ATLAS benchmarking, phase-wise external validation, and a paired
  venous-only versus arterial-plus-venous OpenSwissHCC ablation. The package
  contains code, nnU-Net configurations and folds, case-level metrics,
  reviewer-requested reanalyses, provenance manifests, and primary trained
  checkpoints.

keywords:
  - hepatocellular carcinoma
  - MRI
  - segmentation
  - nnU-Net
  - deep learning
  - external validation
  - reproducibility

repository-code: "https://github.com/gggsgourakis-sketch/HCC-MRI-Segmentation-Reproducibility"
